# CBB Originator 06:10 ET morning timer (10 min after the 06:00 ET training cutoff: the as-of training state is frozen): starts the six-stage chain (cbb-originator-morning.target). systemd evaluates the zone itself (DST-correct).
[Unit]
Description=CBB Originator 06:10 ET daily lifecycle timer (after the 06:00 ET training cutoff)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 06:10:00 America/New_York
AccuracySec=1s
RandomizedDelaySec=0
Persistent=false
Unit=cbb-originator-morning.target

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
